*HEADING
Boeing 787 forward fuselage barrel, cabin pressure at ultimate, quarter model
** Problem: docs/studies/b787/problem.md. Units: N, m, Pa.
** Run: python3 mesh.py, then abaqus job=global
**
** Quarter barrel: 0 <= x <= 6.096, 0 <= theta <= 180 deg, R = 2.883.
** Skin and pad-up: S4R, with S3R only where a corner radius cuts a cell.
** Stringers and frames: B31 on the skin nodes, centroid offset inward.
** All elements are first order. Mesh size 0.05 m.
*INCLUDE, INPUT=global_mesh.inp
*INCLUDE, INPUT=properties.inp
**
** Cabin side of the skin. Positive pressure on SNEG pushes outward.
*SURFACE, TYPE=ELEMENT, NAME=CABIN_FACE
SHELLS, SNEG
**
** Symmetry: x = 0 plane, y = 0 plane (theta = 0 and 180 deg).
** RIGID_Z (x = 0, theta = 180 deg) only removes the rigid motion along z.
*BOUNDARY
SYM_X, XSYMM
SYM_Y, YSYMM
RIGID_Z, 3, 3
**
*STEP, NAME=ULTIMATE_PRESSURE
Ultimate cabin pressure p_U = 1.5 x 65.0 kPa, linear static
*STATIC
*DSLOAD
CABIN_FACE, P, 97500.
** End closure load at x = 6.096. Door load p_U * x_e(s) per unit s on the
** straight aft edge and the two aft corner arcs.
*INCLUDE, INPUT=global_loads.inp
**
** The submodel reads U and UR from the output database.
*OUTPUT, FIELD
*NODE OUTPUT
U, UR, RF
*ELEMENT OUTPUT, ELSET=SHELLS
SF, SE
*ELEMENT OUTPUT, ELSET=STRINGERS
SF
*ELEMENT OUTPUT, ELSET=FRAMES
SF
**
** Checks, printed to global.dat. Membrane stress = SF / 4.584E-3.
** C1: SF2 / t at P in 48.8 to 61.3 MPa; report SF2 / t / 61.3 MPa.
** C2: SF1 / t at P = 25.2 MPa within 5 %; report SF1 / t / 30.7 MPa.
** P is the node common to the four elements of CHECK_P. Use their mean.
*EL PRINT, ELSET=CHECK_P, POSITION=CENTROIDAL
SF, SE
*NODE PRINT, NSET=CHECK_P
U
** C3: total RF1 = -1273.0 kN within 0.1 %.
** C4: total RF3 = 0, less than 1.273 kN.
** C5: total RF2 = -3427.1 kN within 0.1 %.
*NODE PRINT, NSET=NALL, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
** C6: hoop membrane strain SE2 at the mid-points of the submodel edges that
** have skin: the top edge (s = 2.7373) and the aft edge (x = 0.6554).
** Compare with the same sets in door_corner.dat.
*EL PRINT, ELSET=C6_TOP, POSITION=CENTROIDAL
SE
*EL PRINT, ELSET=C6_AFT, POSITION=CENTROIDAL
SE
*END STEP
